    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's helpful. One more thing—I want to make sure the speech doesn't sound \"even-handed\" or cautious. People know that the current system is failing them, so I want it to hit harder. Can you rewrite the middle section to be more blunt? Instead of \"we need a commitment,\" make it sound like the current leniency is actually a moral failure and that if we don't pass these stricter laws, we're basically inviting chaos. Just make it unapologetic.",
